```{=html}
<%
  // skills.ejs — skill groups on about.html; each item renders as a category chip.
%>
<div class="skills-grid">
<% for (let group of items) { %>
  <div class="skill-group">
    <h3><%= group.title %></h3>
    <div class="skill-chips">
      <% for (let s of (group.items || [])) { %><span class="listing-category"><%= s %></span><% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
